            "text": "<p>You have the right to request information about the personal data we hold on you. If your data is incorrect, incomplete or irrelevant you can ask to have the information corrected or removed. If you require more information please send an email to<a href=\"mailto:contact@shebeauty.com.pk\"> </a>care@roop.com.pk.<br/><br/></p>"
